<title>USA: Harvard Scientific CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Harvard Scientific CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harvard Scientific Inc said Tuesday its Chief Financial Officer Thomas Walters resigned on July 18.</p>
<p>President Don Steffens will be acting chief financial officer until the position is filled. Lorenz Hofmann, Ph.D. has been appointed chief operations officer to lead the company through its clinical and FDA process of Phase II/III.</p>
